        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B560P, Grade 2 Commercial Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ANSI Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt is made for mid-level use. It is adjustable for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Good for doors 1-3/8 inches through 1-3/4 inches thicknesses. Built tough, it has a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3 inch screws. Available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt Lock</b> Deadbolt is thrown or retracted by key from outside or by inside turn unit. The bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Commercial B560P Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset with lock in place helix design</li>\r\n<li>Tapered front housing that can't be unscrewed</li>\r\n<li>Warranty:  Commercial 3 year limited, Residential lifetime mechanical</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>1\" wrought metal trim ring reinforced with security insert.</li>\r\n<li>Metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>6-pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5, 2001, Grade 2.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the B500 Series Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\", square corner, box</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" x 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Large, easy to use, ADA Compliant Thumbturn</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Grade 2 Commercial Deadbolt, Schlage B560P",
                "description": "Schlgae B560P Grade 2 Commercial Single Cylinder Deadbolt - This ANSI Grade 2 Single Cylinder Deadbolt is made for mid-level use. It is adjustable for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Good for doors 1-3/8 inches through 1-3/4 inches thicknesses. Built tough, it has a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3 inch screws. Available in 8 finishes.",
